        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/858c86/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-22T12:45:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I missed that my first time through the rulebook too, but when I thought about it, it wouldn't make sense NOT to remove Auto-Misses first.</p><p>If Auto-Misses weren't removed first you could use an Aim Token, roll a 5 as your highest number, and if 5 was an Auto-Miss suddenly all of your attacks miss. &nbsp;That one had me scratching my head until I re-read the rules.</p>",
