        "raw": "[quote=\"phantaskippy\"]\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>Chromium_Man wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">I missed that my first time through the rulebook too, but when I thought about it, it wouldn&#39;t make sense NOT to remove Auto-Misses first.If Auto-Misses weren&#39;t removed first you could use an Aim Token, roll a 5 as your highest number, and if 5 was an Auto-Miss suddenly all of your attacks miss. &nbsp;That one had me scratching my head until I re-read the rules.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nAlso if you rolled a 6 on an aimed Flak Cannon all your dice would auto-miss.\n\n[/quote]\n\nNot true, the auto misses would leave play first then you roll all your dice up to the highest\n",
